<div class="flex flex-col items-center">
<span class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 font-medium">전력수요</span>
<span class="text-base font-bold text-slate-800 font-mono mt-1" id="metric-demand">—</span>
<span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400">MWh</span>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col items-center border-l border-slate-200">
<span class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 font-medium">태양광 발전</span>
<span class="text-base font-bold text-sky-600 font-mono mt-1" id="metric-solar">—</span>
<span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400">MWh</span>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col items-center border-l border-slate-200 bg-orange-50/70 rounded py-0.5">
<span class="text-[11px] text-orange-700 font-semibold">순부하 (수요-PV)</span>
<span class="text-base font-bold text-orange-600 font-mono mt-1" id="metric-netload">—</span>
<span class="text-[10px] text-orange-500">MWh</span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="flex items-center justify-between text-slate-500 text-xs px-1">
<span class="flex items-center gap-1.5 font-medium">
<span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-primary"></span>
            순부하 = 전력수요 - 태양광 발전
          </span>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Legal / Public Notice Footnote -->
<div class="px-1 py-1">
<p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
